{"title":"Monday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/927142025/0/marginalrevolution~Monday-assorted-links.html","date":1762189052000,"content":"<p>1.<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.theguardian.com/wellness/2025/oct/31/lab-grown-chocolate-halloween\" target=\"_blank\"> Lab-grown chocolate?</a></p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://legrandcontinent.eu/fr/2025/11/02/philippe-aghion-prix-nobel-deconomie-2025-grand-entretien/\" target=\"_blank\">Interview with Aghion</a> (in French).  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/Ph_Aghion\" target=\"_blank\">he is now on Twitter</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2025/11/01/britain-courtroom-wigs-lawyers-tradition/\" target=\"_blank\">Wigs in court now optional in Britain?</a></p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://theamericanscholar.org/baby-shoggoth-is-listening/\" target=\"_blank\">Baby Shoggoth is listening</a>.  Good piece.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.thetimes.com/uk/science/article/inside-the-dominic-cummings-dream-lab-chasing-our-ozempic-moment-t0vs2z9h3\" target=\"_blank\">Profile of Aria and Ilan Gur</a> (Times of London).</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://forum.openai.com/public/events/virtual-event-ai-native-nba-slam-dunk-strategy-san-antonio-spurs-ho83la6ose?agenda_day=678a72d034c0bf221bdfa928&amp;agenda_track=678a72d034c0bf221bdfa93c&amp;agenda_stage=678a72d034c0bf221bdfa92d&amp;agenda_filter_view=stage&amp;agenda_view=list\" target=\"_blank\">Are the San Antonio Spurs the NBA’s first all “AI-native” team?</a>  By the way, I saw on Twitter that right now Wemby is favored to win MVP, DPOY, and also Most Improved Player.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/monday-assorted-links-533.html\">Monday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/927142025/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/927142025/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/927142025/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/927142025/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/927142025/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/927142025/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/monday-assorted-links-533.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/monday-assorted-links-533.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/monday-assorted-links-533.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/monday-assorted-links-533.html#comment-160980378\">In reply to Tom Meadowcroft.   It's not a completely new ...</a> <i>by Kaleberg</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com